      "text": "Erba medicinale amarissima.\nRianima un Pokémon esausto e gli restituisce\ntutti i PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A terribly bitter medicinal herb. It revives a fainted\nPokémon and fully restores its max HP.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "とても　にがい　薬草。\nひんしの　ポケモン　１匹の\nＨＰを　すべて　回復する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "非常苦的药草。\n能让１只濒死的宝可梦\n回复所有ＨＰ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hierba muy amarga que reanima a un Pokémon\ndebilitado y restaura todos sus PS.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
